{
    "id":  11027,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Pack 2 L Connectors for LED COB + SMD strips - 8mm - 10mm - IP65",
    "reference":  "CTLIP65-10MM-92070",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover the \u003cstrong\u003ePack of 2 L-Connectors for COB and SMD LED Strips\u003c/strong\u003e, perfect to \u003cstrong\u003eeasily join 8mm and 10mm strips\u003c/strong\u003e at a 90° angle, without soldering. Its \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 water-resistant design\u003c/strong\u003e guarantees a \u003cstrong\u003esecure, durable, and professional connection\u003c/strong\u003e, ideal for indoor or covered outdoor use.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cem\u003eNot suitable for waterproof LED strips.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerfect for creating \u003cstrong\u003eclean, continuous corners with no light gaps\u003c/strong\u003e in profiles, ceilings, or LED furniture, offering a \u003cstrong\u003efast, aesthetic, and high-quality installation\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 8mm and 10mm quick connectors are sold in packs of 2 units.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1 unit = 2 connectors\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eL Connector for COB and SMD LED Strips - 8mm - 10mm - IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur \u003cstrong\u003etransparent connector\u003c/strong\u003e allows joining all types of \u003cstrong\u003e8mm - 10mm LED strips\u003c/strong\u003e. Includes connection cable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatible with 8mm - 10mm LED strips (COB and SMD).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasy installation with quick Click system.\u003c/p\u003e",
